                <pb facs="0826" n="694" sameAs="frus:frus1926v01/pg694"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/7078a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-02-10T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 10,
                                1926—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>39. Central News despatch from Hongkong via London published today reports attack
                    by students and Bolshevist sympathizers on American Presbyterian mission in
                    Kachek, Hainan Island, Kwangtung. Please cable brief report.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
